{"title":"호랑수월가","artist":"상록수","sourceId":"reference:5uihNz5yLQwo8rL8jZCa","sourceHash":"c69f798a088c6f80e3e9738d25d0753096743db1f8dad2af6e0dfd9fa1fef70f","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":23903573,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":22.7,"end":27.3,"text":"흐르는 저 하늘을 물어 채는 범처럼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":27.3,"end":32.0,"text":"태산에 날아들어 숨어드는 새처럼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":32.0,"end":36.5,"text":"동산을 뛰고 뛰어가는 강아지처럼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":36.5,"end":41.0,"text":"온 산에 풍물 막을 내리네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":41.0,"end":45.5,"text":"바람은 지친 끝에 밤에 몸을 뉘이네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":45.5,"end":50.1,"text":"별빛은 아득하니 은하수를 내리네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":50.1,"end":54.7,"text":"차가운 밤하늘에 세상이 젖어 가네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":54.7,"end":59.0,"text":"그리워 홀로 타령을 하자","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":59.0,"end":63.4,"text":"흘러가라 사랑, 사랑아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":63.4,"end":68.2,"text":"덧없이 피고 떨어지는 꽃송아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":68.2,"end":72.4,"text":"애닲구나 가락, 가락아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":72.4,"end":79.6,"text":"눈물에 떨어진 별을 헤네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":79.6,"end":83.9,"text":"푸른 달아, 오랜 고운 내 달아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":83.9,"end":88.8,"text":"비친 내 손에 내려다오","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":88.8,"end":93.0,"text":"은색 소매 내 곁에 두른 채로","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":93.0,"end":98.08,"text":"한 번만 타는 입을 축여다오","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":98.08,"end":102.1,"text":"푸른 달아, 다시 없을 내 달아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":102.1,"end":107.1,"text":"뻗은 손끝에 닿아다오","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":107.1,"end":111.3,"text":"달빛만이 흘러 바다가 되고","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":111.3,"end":118.8,"text":"지쳐 전하지 못하는 수월가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":118.8,"end":123.2,"text":"고요한 바다 위로 내 노래가 떠 간다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":123.2,"end":127.75,"text":"소리도 부끄러워 숨죽이고 떠 간다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":127.75,"end":132.5,"text":"달빛에 젖은 몸을 내놓고서 떠 간다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":132.5,"end":137.0,"text":"한낮이 비쳐 오를 때까지","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":137.0,"end":141.5,"text":"풍성한 가지 끝에 걸쳐 있던 연으로","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":141.5,"end":146.0,"text":"바람에 떨어져서 표류하던 잎으로","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":146.0,"end":150.75,"text":"물 위에 갈 데 없는 낡은 길을 짓다가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":150.75,"end":155.0,"text":"그립고 슬퍼 눈을 감으네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":155.0,"end":159.4,"text":"달아, 달아, 애달픈 달아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":159.4,"end":164.1,"text":"피었다 이내 숨어 버릴 허상아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":164.1,"end":168.4,"text":"시리구나 세월, 세월아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":168.4,"end":175.6,"text":"나날을 헤면서 현을 뜯네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":175.6,"end":180.0,"text":"푸른 달아, 오랜 고운 내 달아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":180.0,"end":184.7,"text":"비친 내 손에 내려다오","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":184.7,"end":188.9,"text":"은색 소매 내 곁에 두른 채로","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":188.9,"end":193.9,"text":"한 번만 타는 입을 축여다오","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":193.9,"end":198.2,"text":"푸른달아, 다시 없을 내 달아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":198.2,"end":202.9,"text":"뻗은 손끝에 닿아다오","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":202.9,"end":207.3,"text":"달빛만이 흘러 바다가 되고","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":207.3,"end":213.9,"text":"지쳐 전하지 못하는 수월가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":213.9,"end":218.2,"text":"(나나나나-나나, 나나나나-나나)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":218.2,"end":222.7,"text":"(나나나나-나나-나나나나-나나)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":222.7,"end":227.3,"text":"(나나나나-나나, 나나나나-나나)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":227.3,"end":235.2,"text":"(나나나나-나나-나나나나-나)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":235.2,"end":239.3,"text":"서로 가자, 굽이굽이 쳐 가자","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":239.3,"end":244.0,"text":"하늘에 닿을 너머까지","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":244.0,"end":248.45,"text":"밤아 가라, 훠이훠이 가거라","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":248.45,"end":253.35,"text":"산 위에 걸린 저 달은 태평가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":253.35,"end":257.5,"text":"서로 가자, 굽이굽이 쳐 가자","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":257.5,"end":262.5,"text":"새벽에 닿을 너머까지","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":262.5,"end":266.65,"text":"달빛만이 흘러 바다가 되고","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":266.65,"end":271.6,"text":"지쳐 전하지 못하는 수월가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":271.6,"end":276.0,"text":"하늘을 보며 그리는 풍류가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":276.0,"end":316.0,"text":"손으로 잡을 수 없는 나의 수월가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}